// @reject: the constructor is written together, like every operator since
// @reject: GLB-031: `## Parse("x")` and `##Parse ("x")` are refused with the
// @reject: constructor's own diagnostic. The browser engine used to report
// @reject: `undefined variable '##'` for the first (2026-09-29).
a = ## Parse("x")
b = ##Parse ("x")
>> a b ¶
